       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-RAG-GFM-QUAD.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RAG-GFM-QUAD-PROOFS.
           05  WS-USDA-PRIM-TREE-HOMOMORPH PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MORTON-Z-QUADTREE-BIJECT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAPH-DIFFUSION-SMOOTH   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CONTINUOUS-GFM-CONVERGE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAG-GFM-USDA-QUAD-SEAL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RAG-QUAD-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-RAG-QUAD-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-RAG-QUAD-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-USDA-AND-MORTON.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSION-AND-FLOW.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-RAG-QUAD-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-USDA-AND-MORTON.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-USDA-PRIM-TREE-HOMOMORPH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MORTON-Z-QUADTREE-BIJECT.
       2000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSION-AND-FLOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAPH-DIFFUSION-SMOOTH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONTINUOUS-GFM-CONVERGE.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-RAG-QUAD-PROOFS.
           IF WS-USDA-PRIM-TREE-HOMOMORPH = 1 AND
              WS-MORTON-Z-QUADTREE-BIJECT = 1 AND
              WS-GRAPH-DIFFUSION-SMOOTH = 1 AND
              WS-CONTINUOUS-GFM-CONVERGE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RAG-GFM-USDA-QUAD-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-RAG-QUAD-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-RAG-QUAD-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-RAG-QUAD-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-RAG-QUAD-CODE.
